        callout: { tone: "info", title: "Always the lightest that works", text: "If a gentle pace and <a href='/dentistry-orthodontics/pediatric-dentistry/sedation/nitrous-oxide/'>laughing gas</a> are enough for your child, that's what we'll use. Oral sedation is only when it genuinely helps." },
